  <data name="RaidwideTankbusterTitle" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Raidwide-Detection Improved, Tankbuster Detection Added</value>
  </data>
  <data name="RaidwideTankbusterBody" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Raidwide detection has been improved to now also check for nearby
stack marker visual effects, in addition to the existing raidwide cast detection.
(No change by you is needed for this, it's just expanded now)

Tankbuster detection has been added by checking for visual effects!
Options to mitigate as a tank for these is in the new mitigation options above.

Find the new tankbuster mitigation options here:
PvE Features &gt; [Tank of choice] &gt; Advanced Mitigation Options &gt; Boss Encounter
(can also search for 'Tankbuster' in your tank's configuration)</value>
